00:46:02.545 --> 00:46:04.412
WE'VE KNOWN EACH OTHER A LONG

00:46:04.413 --> 00:46:05.480
TIME, AND CONGRATULATIONS ON

00:46:05.481 --> 00:46:06.381
YOUR SHOW.

00:46:06.382 --> 00:46:08.650
IT'S A BIG SUCCESS, LAURA, BIG

00:46:08.651 --> 00:46:08.983
SUCCESS.

00:46:08.984 --> 00:46:10.718
&gt;&gt; Laura: I APPRECIATE IT.

00:46:10.719 --> 00:46:11.653
TANK YOU, MR. PRESIDENT.

00:46:11.654 --> 00:46:13.121
IF YOU WANT TO STAY ON FOR

00:46:13.122 --> 00:46:14.422
ANOTHER COUPLE MINUTES, THAT'S

00:46:14.423 --> 00:46:15.223
FINE, BUT I DON'T WANT TO TAKE

00:46:15.224 --> 00:46:17.959
HANNITY'S INTERVIEW.

00:46:17.960 --> 00:46:19.060
&gt;&gt; President Trump: IT'S THE

00:46:19.061 --> 00:46:21.029
BATON, WE HAND OFF TO LAURA.

00:46:21.030 --> 00:46:22.730
HE &gt;&gt; Laura: ALL RIGHT,

00:46:22.731 --> 00:46:23.431
MR. PRESIDENT  --

00:46:23.432 --> 00:46:24.299
&gt;&gt; President Trump: THANK YOU

00:46:24.300 --> 00:46:24.599
BOTH.

00:46:24.600 --> 00:46:29.471
YOUR GREAT PATRIOT, YOU LOVE OUR

00:46:29.472 --> 00:46:30.238
COUNTRY, I APPRECIATE IT, AND SO

00:46:30.239 --> 00:46:32.240
DOES EVERYONE ELSE.

00:46:32.241 --> 00:46:32.841
THEY DO APPRECIATE IT.

00:46:32.842 --> 00:46:34.742
THEY REALLY GET IT.

00:46:34.743 --> 00:46:37.045
THE PEOPLE OF THIS COUNTRY, THEY

00:46:37.046 --> 00:46:38.179
GET IT.

00:46:38.180 --> 00:46:39.247
THEY ARE SMART.

00:46:39.248 --> 00:46:39.981
&gt;&gt; Laura: MR. PRESIDENT, DID

00:46:39.982 --> 00:46:43.284
YOU GET BRIEFED ON THIS SYRIAN

00:46:43.285 --> 00:46:44.185
ATTACK OR PLANNED ATTACK ON A

00:46:44.186 --> 00:46:47.455
CHRISTIAN CHURCH IN PITTSBURGH

00:46:47.456 --> 00:46:47.722
YET?

00:46:47.723 --> 00:46:49.624
NEWS BROKE THIS EVENING --

00:46:49.625 --> 00:46:50.592
&gt;&gt; President Trump: I HAVE

00:46:50.593 --> 00:46:51.960
BEEN TOLD ABOUT IT AND LITTLE

00:46:51.961 --> 00:46:54.195
DETAIL, I WILL MEET A LITTLE

00:46:54.196 --> 00:46:55.730
LATER ABOUT IT, ACTUALLY,

00:46:55.731 --> 00:46:57.233
TONIGHT.

